                        <p class="project-lead">
                            <strong
                                >Making a difficult system incremental.</strong
                            >
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Large workloads. Distributed processing. Operational
                            complexity.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            The challenge wasn't simply making it faster. It was
                            changing how the system processed work without
                            breaking everything around it.
                        </p>

