                <p>
                    Not tutorials. Not lists of technologies. Not “10 things I
                    learned this week”.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Technical stories about real systems — what made them
                    difficult, what decisions were made, what went wrong, and
                    why the architecture ended up the way it did.
                </p>

                <a href="/notebook">Explore the Engineering Notebook &rarr;</a>
            </section>
